   "section": "vc-row",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Celebrate your event in Casa Argentera"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "We will be happy to help you with the organization of"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "the event you have in mind."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "We have a big dinning/meeting room to small parties or meetings, team buildings, or workshops or courses. If the weather is good (as usual), the garden is also a perfect option."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Here are some suggestions, to be combined in any way that suits you:"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": ","
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "tapas-workshop"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "wine- or olive oil tastings"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "spent a day with a shepherd"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "meditation or yoga"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "painting or paella contests"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "calçotadas"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "bike training camps"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Maybe you would like your course or training to end with a competition in a local race, e.g. Gran Fondo Priorat or Cambrils, or participate in the annual quick painting contest, or for your team-building event to include a paella contest, or a tapas workshops, just write us with your ideas and we will help you organize."
    }
   ],
